    "question_en": "In the Class D Manual Hill Test (page 221), after the examiner gives the signal to move off from the yellow line on the hill crest, what is the exact clutch-and-handbrake technique to climb forward without rolling back?",
    "question_ms": "Dalam ujian Bukit Kelas D Manual (halaman 221), selepas penguji memberi isyarat bergerak dari garisan kuning di puncak bukit, apakah teknik koordinasi cekam, pemecut dan brek tangan yang betul supaya kereta tidak menggelongsor ke belakang?",
