    "order_index": 13,
    "question_en": "When performing tight low-speed circuit manoeuvres in a Class D Manual car — such as Side Parking (Parkir Sisi), Bay Parking (Parkir Membelok), Three-Point Turn (Pusingan Tiga Penjuru), or Selekor S & Z (pages 224–244) — how do you control the car at walking pace without stalling?",
