    "correct_index": 2,
    "explanation_en": "Precise half-clutch modulation around the biting point lets a manual driver inch into tight parking bays and through the Z-course without stalling or lurching. (KPP Kelas D Manual (2021), KPP02, m/s 224-244)",
    "explanation_ms": "Kawalan separuh cekam (half-clutch) yang halus pada titik pergerakan membolehkan kereta manual bergerak perlahan-lahan di ruang sempit tanpa enjin mati. (KPP Kelas D Manual (2021), KPP02, m/s 224-244)",
