    "correct_index": 3,
    "explanation_en": "Scheduled KEJARA offences apply strictly to both CDL/commercial drivers (6 pts) and PDL holders (4 pts toward the 20-point revocation limit). (KPP Kelas DA/D (2021), KPP01, Rule 4 LN 166/59, m/s 171)",
    "explanation_ms": "Kesalahan terjadual KEJARA terpakai kepada pemandu perdagangan (6 mata) serta pemegang PDL (4 mata ke arah had 20 mata pembatalan lesen). (KPP Kelas DA/D (2021), KPP01, Rule 4 LN 166/59, m/s 171)",
