    "question_en": "According to the KPP01 Scheduled KEJARA Offences table (Section 45C APJ 1987, m/s 170), how many demerit points are recorded against a private motor car driver for: 'Failing to stop when required for a breathalyzer / alcohol or drug test'?",
    "question_ms": "Berdasarkan Jadual Kesalahan Terjadual KEJARA KPP01 (Section 45C APJ 1987, m/s 170), berapakah mata demerit yang dikenakan ke atas pemandu kenderaan persendirian bagi kesalahan: 'Gagal berhenti atau enggan menjalani ujian pernafasan alkohol/dadah'?",
