    "explanation_en": "Under the KEJARA schedule (Section 45C APJ 1987, m/s 170), 'Failing to stop when required for a breathalyzer / alcohol or drug test' carries 10 demerit points for a private driver (and 10 points for a commercial vehicle driver). (KPP Kelas DA/D (2021), KPP01, Section 45C APJ 1987, m/s 170)",
    "explanation_ms": "Di bawah jadual KEJARA (Section 45C APJ 1987, m/s 170), kesalahan 'Gagal berhenti atau enggan menjalani ujian pernafasan alkohol/dadah' membawa 10 mata demerit bagi pemandu persendirian (dan 10 mata bagi pemandu kenderaan perdagangan). (KPP Kelas DA/D (2021), KPP01, Section 45C APJ 1987, m/s 170)",
